                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Schools were juggling disconnected tools for student records, health checks and assessment banks — each with its own login and its own version of the truth. The goal was one platform where staff could move between services without friction and trust the data they saw.",
